<h2 id="about">💫 About</h2>

`packageIdentifier` returns `@sgx4u/{{packageName}}`. The implementation, the folder `index.ts`, and the test live in `src/package-identifier/`. `src/index.ts` re-exports it. Replace the stub, and the sentence in the header, before the first release.

Experimental (`0.x`). Breaking changes may land in minor versions until 1.0.0.

<p align="right">(<a href="#readme-top">back to top</a>)</p>

<br />

<h2 id="installation">📥 Installation</h2>

{{#if (eq packageKind 'config')}}
This preset stays in this repository. It is a workspace dev dependency and is not published.

`import` loads `dist/index.js` with `dist/index.d.ts`. The export map lists `@sgx4u/source` before `import`, pointing at `src/index.ts`. TypeScript uses that condition when `customConditions` includes `@sgx4u/source`. The TypeScript configuration in this repository sets that condition, so workspace builds load the source. Other resolvers load `dist`.
{{else}}
```sh
pnpm add @sgx4u/{{packageName}}       # pnpm
npm install @sgx4u/{{packageName}}    # npm
yarn add @sgx4u/{{packageName}}       # yarn
```

Requires Node `>=22.12`. The package publishes ESM (`import`) and CommonJS (`require`). The export map lists `@sgx4u/source` before `import` and `require`, pointing at `src/index.ts`. TypeScript uses that condition when `customConditions` includes `@sgx4u/source`. The TypeScript configuration in this repository sets that condition, so workspace builds load the source. Other resolvers load `dist`.
{{/if}}

